abstract: >-
  A comprehensive Python package for generating and
  visualizing Mandelbrot and Julia set fractals. FractalSets
  provides high-performance, Numba-optimized algorithms for
  fractal generation, extensive visualization capabilities
  with multiple colormaps, and a gallery of famous fractals.
  Originally translated from R implementation, this package
  offers both simple interfaces for beginners and advanced
  features for researchers in computational mathematics,
  chaos theory, and algorithmic art.
